# Debug and temporary test files (root level only) - anchored with a
# leading "/" so this only matches the repo root, not tests/unit/ and
# tests/integration/ (an unanchored `test_*.py` matches at every depth in
# gitignore syntax, which was silently excluding the ENTIRE real pytest
# suite under tests/ from version control - confirmed directly: 34
# tests/unit/test_*.py files exist on disk, 0 were tracked by git before
# this fix).
/test_*.py
/diagnose_*.py
/cleanup_*.py

